From 77c878f3e8a4d3d86a9e667cdd6f5d60082aaa8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: apranikstar <trialoftheniku@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 21:39:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 15/15] Rename ARCFastSim to ARCTracing

The module is named by what it does, ray tracing of the ARC optics; a Delphes
module is a fast simulation by definition. The card instance name stays ARCPID.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KP5vqAGH2XiGXWtPhaonke
